    "@value": "Refining operating costs, excluding planned turnaround and depreciation and amortization, per barrel of throughput."
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme": [
   {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/kpi/Measures"
