    "@language": "en",
    "@value": "Planned turnaround costs, and depreciation and amortization."
   }
  ],
  "https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/population/includes": [
   {
    "@language": "en",
    "@value": "Refining operating costs, driven mainly by the energy the refineries use and the level of maintenance. The company figure is per barrel of net throughput; the regional figure is per barrel of gross throughput, which includes inter-refinery transfer volumes."
   }
  ],
  "https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/population/populationEvidence": [
